      <p>Today Fotografiska is regarded as one of Sweden's leading cultural institutions. Following the success of the Stockholm museum, additional Fotografiska museums have opened in New York, Berlin, Shanghai and other cities, establishing the brand as one of the world's best-known centres for contemporary photography.</p>
