      <p>One of the museum's highlights is the famous <strong>Gold Room</strong>, which contains Sweden's largest collection of gold and silver treasures. The exhibition includes royal jewellery, religious artefacts, ancient necklaces, bracelets and thousands of archaeological discoveries, some dating back more than fifteen hundred years.</p>

